  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "How to replicate:\nNote: You must have two (or more) people in the same instance.\n1: Have the minimum displayed performance rank set to medium.\n2: Make sure that the other person's avatar is shown using safety settings.\n3: Have the other person change into an avatar that is poor or very poor only because of the bounds.\nExpected result: The other person's avatar changes into their fallback avatar because of the avatar's performance rank.\nActual result: The avatar shows as it would if it weren't ranked poor or very poor.\nAnother thing to note: If you have more than two people in the room, try having following the same steps with the other people, but have them select an avatar that's ranked poor or very poor because of anything other than bounds.",
